    "sections": {
        "description": "The Interior Store WordPress Theme is a beautifully crafted, fully responsive theme designed specifically for interior design stores, furniture shops, and home decor boutiques. Whether you're running a modern furniture showroom, an online decor store, or a home styling boutique, this theme offers a perfect platform to showcase your products with elegance and style. With a clean layout and modern design elements, it supports a wide variety of interior decor items, including designer furniture, lighting fixtures, decorative vases, wall art, and soft furnishings. This theme is ideal for creating a visually rich shopping experience that appeals to customers looking for elegant home style, luxury home decor, or trendy room styling ideas. From bedroom essentials to living room furniture and kitchen decor, you can display your collections using intuitive product grids and beautiful image galleries. Built with SEO-optimized code and fast loading times, the theme helps boost your store’s visibility and performance. Eye-catching banners, interactive sliders, and customizable homepage sections allow for flexible content presentation. Integrated with WooCommerce, it offers smooth e-commerce functionality, making it easier to manage product listings, accept payments, and run promotions. The theme also supports decor blog sections, testimonials, and CTA buttons to convert visitors into loyal customers."
    },
